  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till r&#xe4;ttssektorreformutveckling inklusive &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng till    r&#xe4;ttvisa i &#xf6;stra DR Kongo (Nord- och Sydkivu och Ituri).              Samfinansierat (Transfer Agreement) mellan EU-kommissionen (ledande   givare 10 milj euro), Sverige (60 000 000 SEK) och Belgien (2 milj    euro), inom ramen f&#xf6;r den 10:e Europeiska Utvecklingsfonden (EDF 10).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to justice sector reform development including increased      access to justice in Eastern Congo (North+South Kivu and Ituri).      Co-financing arrangement (Transfer Agreement) between the EU          Commission (Lead donor 10 mill euro), Sweden (60 000 000 SEK) and     Belgium (2 mill euro), within the framework of the 10th European      Development Fund (10th EDF).</narrative>
  </description>
